# NVIDIA Config Manager Extra Charts Configuration
# Format: 
#   chart-name:version                              - pulls from NGC (requires NGC_API_KEY)
#   oci://registry/path/chart:version               - pulls from OCI registry
#   helm://repo-url|chart-name:version              - pulls from traditional Helm repo
# One chart per line
#
# Operator/dependency charts are generated from ../operator-versions.env.
# Add only deployment-specific extra charts here.
